{"v":1,"L":[
{"id":"a-dekl","t":"A-Deklination","s":"puella, Vokativ und Ablativ","r":["Latein kennt drei Geschlechter und keine Artikel.","Endungen A-Deklination: Sg. -a, -ae, -ae, -am, -a, -a; Pl. -ae, -arum, -is, -as, -ae, -is.","Grammatisch sind A-Wörter weiblich. Das natürliche Geschlecht geht vor: poeta clarus = der berühmte Dichter, agricola aeger = der kranke Bauer. (fagus alta = die hohe Buche, hier ist es weiblich.)","Vokativ = Anrede, 5. Fall (puella! = Mädchen!).","Ablativus instrumenti: womit? wodurch? Präpositionen mit Ablativ: ab (ab, von), ex/e (aus), de (von), cum (mit), sine (ohne), pro (für), prae (vor)."],"T":[{"n":"A-Deklination Endungen","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","-a","-ae"],["2. Fall","-ae","-arum"],["3. Fall","-ae","-is"],["4. Fall","-am","-as"],["5. Fall","-a","-ae"],["6. Fall","-a","-is"]]},{"n":"puella (das Mädchen)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","puella","puellae"],["2. Fall","puellae","puellarum"],["3. Fall","puellae","puellis"],["4. Fall","puellam","puellas"],["5. Fall","puella","puellae"],["6. Fall","puella","puellis"]]}],"Q":[["Welches Geschlecht hat poeta (Dichter)?","männlich (natürliches Geschlecht geht vor)",["weiblich","sächlich","alle drei"],"Wörter der A-Deklination sind grammatisch weiblich, aber das natürliche Geschlecht hat Vorrang."],["-ae kann bei puella sein:","Gen. Sg., Dat. Sg. oder Nom. Pl.",["nur Nom. Pl.","nur Gen. Sg.","Akk. Pl."],""],["Was bedeutet die Präposition ex/e?","aus",["mit","ohne","für"],""],["Was bedeutet die Präposition sine?","ohne",["mit","für","von"],""],["Was bedeutet die Präposition prae?","vor",["für","von","aus"],""],["Was bedeutet die Präposition pro?","für",["vor","ohne","mit"],""],["Der Ablativus instrumenti antwortet auf die Frage …","womit? wodurch?",["wann?","wohin?","für wen?"],""]]},
{"id":"o-dekl","t":"O-Deklination","s":"servus, puer, ager, verbum","r":["Drei Gruppen: -us, -i (murus, servus), -er, -(e)ri (puer, ager) und -um, -i (vallum, verbum).","-us/-er sind männlich, -um sächlich.","Vokativ bei -us: -e (serve!). Neutrum: Nom. = Akk. = Vok., im Plural -a."],"T":[{"n":"servus (Sklave)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","servus","servi"],["2. Fall","servi","servorum"],["3. Fall","servo","servis"],["4. Fall","servum","servos"],["5. Fall","serve","servi"],["6. Fall","servo","servis"]]},{"n":"puer (Knabe)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","puer","pueri"],["2. Fall","pueri","puerorum"],["3. Fall","puero","pueris"],["4. Fall","puerum","pueros"],["5. Fall","puer","pueri"],["6. Fall","puero","pueris"]]},{"n":"ager (Acker)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","ager","agri"],["2. Fall","agri","agrorum"],["3. Fall","agro","agris"],["4. Fall","agrum","agros"],["5. Fall","ager","agri"],["6. Fall","agro","agris"]]},{"n":"verbum (Wort)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","verbum","verba"],["2. Fall","verbi","verborum"],["3. Fall","verbo","verbis"],["4. Fall","verbum","verba"],["5. Fall","verbum","verba"],["6. Fall","verbo","verbis"]]}],"Q":[["Was heißt murus?","Mauer",["Wall","Acker","Wort"],""],["Was heißt vallum?","Wall",["Mauer","Sklave","Knabe"],""],["Der Plural von verbum im Nom./Akk. lautet:","verba",["verbi","verbos","verbum"],""],["Welche Form ist der Gen. Sg. von ager?","agri",["agro","ageri","agrum"],"Bei ager fällt das -e- weg: ager, agri."]]},
{"id":"adj-ao","t":"Adjektive a-/o-Deklination","s":"bonus, liber, pulcher, KNG","r":["Das Adjektiv stimmt mit dem Substantiv in Kasus, Numerus und Genus überein (KNG).","Im Stowasser steht -us3 (alt) bzw. -us/-a/-um (neu). Adjektive auf -er stehen mit allen Nominativformen.","Substantivierte Adjektive: Plural maskulin = Personen (boni = die Guten), Plural neutrum = Dinge (bona = das Gute, die guten Dinge).","Verwechslungsgefahr: liber (Buch, libri) und liberi (Kinder) vs. liber, libera, liberum (frei)."],"T":[{"n":"bonus, -a, -um (Singular)","c":["m","f","n"],"r":[["1. Fall","bonus","bona","bonum"],["2. Fall","boni","bonae","boni"],["3. Fall","bono","bonae","bono"],["4. Fall","bonum","bonam","bonum"],["5. Fall","bone","bona","bonum"],["6. Fall","bono","bona","bono"]]},{"n":"bonus, -a, -um (Plural)","c":["m","f","n"],"r":[["1. Fall","boni","bonae","bona"],["2. Fall","bonorum","bonarum","bonorum"],["3. Fall","bonis","bonis","bonis"],["4. Fall","bonos","bonas","bona"],["5. Fall","boni","bonae","bona"],["6. Fall","bonis","bonis","bonis"]]},{"n":"liber, -a, -um (frei), maskulin","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","liber","liberi"],["2. Fall","liberi","liberorum"],["3. Fall","libero","liberis"],["4. Fall","liberum","liberos"],["5. Fall","liber","liberi"],["6. Fall","libero","liberis"]]},{"n":"pulcher, -ra, -rum (schön), maskulin","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","pulcher","pulchri"],["2. Fall","pulchri","pulchrorum"],["3. Fall","pulchro","pulchris"],["4. Fall","pulchrum","pulchros"],["5. Fall","pulcher","pulchri"],["6. Fall","pulchro","pulchris"]]},{"n":"liber (das Buch)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","liber","libri"],["2. Fall","libri","librorum"],["3. Fall","libro","libris"],["4. Fall","librum","libros"],["5. Fall","liber","libri"],["6. Fall","libro","libris"]]}],"Q":[["boni (Nom. Pl. m.) als Hauptwort bedeutet:","die Guten (Menschen)",["die guten Dinge","das Gute","gute Frauen"],""],["bona (Nom. Pl. n.) als Hauptwort bedeutet:","die guten Dinge, das Gute",["die Guten (Menschen)","gute Männer","die gute Frau"],""],["multa bedeutet:","vieles, viele Dinge",["viele Menschen","viel Zeit","vielmals"],""],["liberi (Nom. Pl.) bedeutet:","Kinder (oder freie Männer)",["Bücher","die Bücher des","Freiheit"],"libri = Bücher, liberi = Kinder. Nicht verwechseln!"],["libri (Nom. Pl.) bedeutet:","Bücher",["Kinder","frei","Freiheit"],""],["Welche Form ist der Gen. Sg. von pulcher?","pulchri",["pulcheri","pulchro","pulcher"],""],["Das Adjektiv stimmt mit dem Substantiv überein in:","Kasus, Numerus, Genus",["nur Kasus","nur Genus","Person und Zeit"],""]]},
{"id":"konj-a-e","t":"A- und E-Konjugation (Präsens)","s":"laudare, monere, esse","r":["Die Person erkennt man an der Endung, das Personalpronomen steht meist nicht.","Das Verb steht meist (nicht immer) am Satzende.","A-Konjugation: -o, -(a)s, -(a)t, -(a)mus, -(a)tis, -(a)nt. Infinitiv -are, Imperativ -a/-ate.","E-Konjugation: -(e)o, -(e)s, -(e)t, -(e)mus, -(e)tis, -(e)nt. Infinitiv -ere, Imperativ -e/-ete.","Im Stowasser: alt 1. Person Sg. + Ziffer (-o1 / -eo2), neu der Infinitiv (-are / -ere)."],"T":[{"n":"laudare (loben), Präsens","c":["Präsens"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","laudo"],["2. Pers. Sg.","laudas"],["3. Pers. Sg.","laudat"],["1. Pers. Pl.","laudamus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","laudatis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","laudant"]]},{"n":"monere (mahnen), Präsens","c":["Präsens"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","moneo"],["2. Pers. Sg.","mones"],["3. Pers. Sg.","monet"],["1. Pers. Pl.","monemus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","monetis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","monent"]]},{"n":"esse (sein), Präsens","c":["Präsens"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","sum"],["2. Pers. Sg.","es"],["3. Pers. Sg.","est"],["1. Pers. Pl.","sumus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","estis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","sunt"]]}],"Q":[["Wie lautet der Imperativ Sg. von laudare?","lauda!",["laudo!","laudare!","laudat!"],""],["Wie lautet der Imperativ Pl. von monere?","monete!",["monite!","mone!","monent!"],""],["laudamus heißt:","wir loben",["ihr lobt","sie loben","ich lobe"],""],["monetis heißt:","ihr mahnt",["wir mahnen","du mahnst","sie mahnen"],""],["Was steht im neuen Stowasser bei Verben?","der Infinitiv",["die 1. Person Singular","der Genitiv","das PPP"],""],["Wo steht das Verb im lateinischen Satz meist?","am Satzende",["am Satzanfang","an zweiter Stelle","immer nach dem Subjekt"],""]]},
{"id":"imperfekt","t":"Imperfekt","s":"A-/E-Konjugation und esse","r":["Imperfekt = Zeitwortstamm (inkl. Vokal) + -ba- + Personalendung.","Endungen: -bam, -bas, -bat, -bamus, -batis, -bant.","esse: er- + Personalendung ohne -b-: eram, eras, erat, eramus, eratis, erant."],"T":[{"n":"laudare, Imperfekt","c":["Imperfekt"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","laudabam"],["2. Pers. Sg.","laudabas"],["3. Pers. Sg.","laudabat"],["1. Pers. Pl.","laudabamus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","laudabatis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","laudabant"]]},{"n":"monere, Imperfekt","c":["Imperfekt"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","monebam"],["2. Pers. Sg.","monebas"],["3. Pers. Sg.","monebat"],["1. Pers. Pl.","monebamus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","monebatis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","monebant"]]},{"n":"esse, Imperfekt","c":["Imperfekt"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","eram"],["2. Pers. Sg.","eras"],["3. Pers. Sg.","erat"],["1. Pers. Pl.","eramus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","eratis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","erant"]]}],"Q":[["Woran erkennt man das Imperfekt (A-/E-Konjugation)?","-ba- vor der Personalendung",["-bi-","-av-","-eram"],""],["laudabat heißt:","er lobte",["er wird loben","er hat gelobt","er lobt"],""],["monebamus heißt:","wir mahnten",["wir mahnen","wir werden mahnen","wir haben gemahnt"],""],["eram heißt:","ich war",["ich bin","ich werde sein","ich bin gewesen"],""]]},
{"id":"pronomen1","t":"Personal- und Possessivpronomen","s":"ego, tu, suus vs. eius","r":["Reflexivpronomen der 3. Person (sui) hat keinen Nominativ.","Possessivpronomen werden nach A-/O-Deklination dekliniert.","suus bezieht sich auf das Subjekt des Satzes (reflexiv). Bezieht sich der Besitz nicht auf das Subjekt, steht eius (Sg.) bzw. eorum/earum (Pl.).","Substantivisch: mei (m. Pl.) = die Meinen, mea (n. Pl.) = das Meine."],"T":[{"n":"ego / tu","c":["ego (1. Sg.)","tu (2. Sg.)"],"r":[["1. Fall","ego","tu"],["2. Fall","mei","tui"],["3. Fall","mihi","tibi"],["4. Fall","me","te"],["6. Fall","a me/mecum","a te/tecum"]]},{"n":"nos / vos","c":["nos (1. Pl.)","vos (2. Pl.)"],"r":[["1. Fall","nos","vos"],["2. Fall","nostri/nostrum","vestri/vestrum"],["3. Fall","nobis","vobis"],["4. Fall","nos","vos"],["6. Fall","a nobis/nobiscum","a vobis/vobiscum"]]},{"n":"Reflexivpronomen (3. Person)","c":["se (Sg. und Pl.)"],"r":[["1. Fall","-"],["2. Fall","sui"],["3. Fall","sibi"],["4. Fall","se"],["6. Fall","a se/secum"]]},{"n":"Possessivpronomen","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Person","meus, mea, meum","noster, nostra, nostrum"],["2. Person","tuus, tua, tuum","vester, vestra, vestrum"],["3. Person","suus, sua, suum","suus, sua, suum"]]}],"Q":[["Marcus amicum suum videt. heißt:","Markus sieht seinen (eigenen) Freund.",["Markus sieht dessen Freund.","Markus sieht ihren Freund.","Markus sieht unseren Freund."],""],["Parentes eius Romam iter faciunt. heißt:","Dessen Eltern machen eine Reise nach Rom.",["Seine eigenen Eltern machen eine Reise nach Rom.","Die Eltern machen eine Reise mit ihm.","Ihre Eltern reisen nach Rom."],""],["eorum (bezogen auf Plural) bedeutet:","deren",["ihre eigenen","unsere","euer"],""],["mei (Nom. Pl. m., substantivisch) bedeutet:","die Meinen (Familie, Angehörige)",["mein Ding","meine Dinge","mir"],""],["mea (Nom. Pl. n., substantivisch) bedeutet:","das Meine (meine Dinge)",["die Meinen","meine Frauen","mit mir"],""],["mecum heißt:","mit mir",["mit mich","ohne mich","für mich"],""],["Welches Wort ist das Reflexivpronomen der 3. Person?","se",["is","eius","suus"],""]]},
{"id":"frage-gen","t":"Fragepronomen, Teilungsgenitiv, Dativ des Vorteils","s":"quis, nemo nostrum, Non scholae …","r":["Interrogativpronomen substantivisch: quis? (wer?) / quid? (was?).","Genitivus partitivus: Substantiv oder Personalpronomen im Plural im 2. Fall, bezieht sich immer auf ein Bezugswort. Übersetzung: Genitiv, „von“ oder ohne Präposition.","Dativus commodi: Dativ auf die Frage „für wen? wofür?“, übersetzt mit „für“ + Akkusativ."],"T":[{"n":"quis / quid","c":["Frage"],"r":[["1. Fall","quis? / quid?"],["2. Fall","cuius?"],["3. Fall","cui?"],["4. Fall","quem? / quid?"],["6. Fall","a quo? / quocum?"]]}],"Q":[["nemo nostrum heißt:","niemand von uns",["niemand unter ihnen","keiner von euch","unser Niemand"],""],["quis vestrum heißt:","wer von euch",["wer von uns","wessen Haus","wen von euch"],""],["multum temporis heißt:","viel Zeit",["viele Zeiten","mehrmals","zu spät"],""],["satis vini heißt:","genug Wein",["Wein genug mal","mit Wein","sehr alter Wein"],""],["Non scholae, sed vitae discimus. heißt:","Nicht für die Schule, sondern für das Leben lernen wir.",["Nicht in der Schule, sondern im Leben lernen wir.","Nicht die Schule, sondern das Leben lehrt uns.","Nicht von der Schule, sondern vom Leben lernen wir."],""],["Ille locus tibi aptus est. heißt:","Jener Ort ist für dich geeignet.",["Jener Ort gehört dir.","Du bist an jenem Ort geeignet.","Jener Ort ist dir ähnlich."],""],["Der Dativus commodi antwortet auf die Frage …","für wen? wofür?",["wem gehört es?","wann?","womit?"],""]]},
{"id":"zeit-ort","t":"Zeit, „und“, Ortsangaben","s":"quamdiu, quando, -que, Romae","r":["quamdiu? (wie lange?) = Akkusativ = Zeitraum. quando? (wann?) = Ablativ = Zeitpunkt.","„und“: et, ac/atque (stehen zwischen den Wörtern) oder -que (am Ende des zweiten Wortes). Im Deutschen steht „und“ VOR dem Wort: pater filiusque = Vater und Sohn.","Orte (Städtenamen) ohne Präposition: wo? = Lokativ bei -us/-a/-um (wie Genitiv: Romae, Corinthi, Carnunti), sonst Ablativ (Carthagine, Neapoli, Athenis). woher? = immer Ablativ. wohin? = immer Akkusativ."],"T":[{"n":"Ortsangaben (Städte)","c":["wo?","woher?","wohin?"],"r":[["Korinth","Corinthi","Corintho","Corinthum"],["Rom","Romae","Roma","Romam"],["Karnuntum","Carnunti","Carnunto","Carnuntum"],["Karthago","Carthagine","Carthagine","Carthaginem"],["Neapel","Neapoli","Neapoli","Neapolim"],["Athen","Athenis","Athenis","Athenas"]]}],"Q":[["quamdiu? fragt nach …","dem Zeitraum (Akkusativ)",["dem Zeitpunkt (Ablativ)","dem Ort","dem Grund"],""],["quando? fragt nach …","dem Zeitpunkt (Ablativ)",["dem Zeitraum (Akkusativ)","dem Ort","der Art und Weise"],""],["Duas horas laboro. heißt:","Ich arbeite zwei Stunden lang.",["Ich arbeite zur zweiten Stunde.","Ich arbeitete zwei Stunden.","Ich werde zwei Stunden arbeiten."],""],["Hora quarta adero. heißt:","Ich werde zur vierten Stunde anwesend sein.",["Ich war vier Stunden anwesend.","Ich bin die vierte Stunde da.","Ich bin vier Stunden lang da."],""],["pater filiusque heißt:","Vater und Sohn",["der Sohn des Vaters","Vater oder Sohn","Vater, der Sohn"],""],["Wo steht das deutsche „und“ bei -que?","vor dem Wort, an das -que angehängt ist",["nach dem Wort","am Satzende","gar nicht"],""],["Romam heißt:","nach Rom",["in Rom","aus Rom","für Rom"],""],["Roma (Abl.) heißt:","aus Rom",["nach Rom","in Rom","von Rom aus nach"],""],["Athenis heißt:","in Athen",["nach Athen","aus Athen","für Athen"],""]]},
{"id":"futur","t":"Futur I","s":"A-/E-Konjugation und esse","r":["Futur I A-/E-Konjugation = Zeitwortstamm + -b- + Personalendung: -bo, -bis, -bit, -bimus, -bitis, -bunt.","esse: er- + Personalendung des Futurs ohne -b-: ero, eris, erit, erimus, eritis, erunt."],"T":[{"n":"laudare, Futur I","c":["Futur I"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","laudabo"],["2. Pers. Sg.","laudabis"],["3. Pers. Sg.","laudabit"],["1. Pers. Pl.","laudabimus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","laudabitis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","laudabunt"]]},{"n":"monere, Futur I","c":["Futur I"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","monebo"],["2. Pers. Sg.","monebis"],["3. Pers. Sg.","monebit"],["1. Pers. Pl.","monebimus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","monebitis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","monebunt"]]},{"n":"esse, Futur I","c":["Futur I"],"r":[["1. Pers. Sg.","ero"],["2. Pers. Sg.","eris"],["3. Pers. Sg.","erit"],["1. Pers. Pl.","erimus"],["2. Pers. Pl.","eritis"],["3. Pers. Pl.","erunt"]]}],"Q":[["laudabit heißt:","er wird loben",["er lobte","er lobt","er hat gelobt"],""],["monebimus heißt:","wir werden mahnen",["wir mahnten","wir mahnen","wir haben gemahnt"],""],["erit heißt:","er wird sein",["er war","er ist","er ist gewesen"],""],["Das Zeichen des Futurs I bei A-/E-Konjugation ist …","-b-",["-ba-","-av-","-er-"],""]]},
{"id":"e-u-dekl","t":"E- und U-Deklination","s":"res, manus, cornu","r":["E-Deklination: Sg. -es, -ei, -ei, -em, -es, -e; Pl. -es, -erum, -ebus, -es, -es, -ebus. Beispiele: res, rei (Sache); spes, spei (Hoffnung). Sonderfall dies, diei (m. Tag; f. Termin, Frist).","U-Deklination -us, -us: Sg. -us, -us, -ui, -um, -us, -u; Pl. -us, -uum, -ibus, -us, -us, -ibus. Beispiele: casus (Fall), manus (Hand), exercitus (Heer). Sonderfall domus (teils O-Deklination), Lokativ domi = zu Hause.","U-Deklination -u, -us (Neutrum): z. B. cornu, cornus (Horn)."],"T":[{"n":"res (Sache)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","res","res"],["2. Fall","rei","rerum"],["3. Fall","rei","rebus"],["4. Fall","rem","res"],["5. Fall","res","res"],["6. Fall","re","rebus"]]},{"n":"manus (Hand)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","manus","manus"],["2. Fall","manus","manuum"],["3. Fall","manui","manibus"],["4. Fall","manum","manus"],["5. Fall","manus","manus"],["6. Fall","manu","manibus"]]},{"n":"cornu (Horn)","c":["Sg.","Pl."],"r":[["1. Fall","cornu","cornua"],["2. Fall","cornus","cornuum"],["3. Fall","cornu","cornibus"],["4. Fall","cornu","cornua"],["5. Fall","cornu","cornua"],["6. Fall","cornu","cornibus"]]}],"Q":[["res, rei heißt:","Sache",["Hoffnung","Hand","Tag"],""],["spes, spei heißt:","Hoffnung, Erwartung",["Sache","Fall","Heer"],""],["domi heißt:","zu Hause",["nach Hause","von zu Hause","des Hauses"],""],["dies, diei ist maskulin mit der Bedeutung …","Tag",["Termin, Frist","Hoffnung","Sache"],"Als Femininum bedeutet dies Termin, Frist."],["manus heißt:","Hand",["Heer","Fall","Horn"],""],["exercitus heißt:","Heer",["Hand","Fall","Horn"],""],["casus heißt:","Fall",["Heer","Hand","Horn"],""]]}
]}
